+/**
+ *  field-survey patch: zoom so the rect (PDF user space of the current page) fills the view and
+ *  centre it. Used for "fit" (the CropBox) and to bring a pin or cluster into view. The fit may be
+ *  below minScaleFactor (the stock fit from _fixScaleFactor can be off on the new architecture), so
+ *  the floor is lowered to it: the user can always pinch back out to the whole sheet.
